{
  "dom_id": "step-142505",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Converting From Kilograms to Grams",
  "problem": "What is $0.2 \\,\\textrm{kg}$ expressed in $\\textrm g?$",
  "worked_solution": "We start by recalling the conversion table for mass units. \n\n| Name | Symbol | Conversion |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Kilogram | $\\textrm{kg}$ | $1\\,\\textrm{kg} = 1\\,000\\,\\textrm{g}$ |\n| Gram | $\\textrm{g}$ | Base Unit |\n| Milligram | $\\textrm{mg}$ | $1\\,000\\,\\textrm{mg} = 1\\,\\textrm{g}$ |\n\nThere are $1000\\,\\textrm g$ per $\\textrm{kg},$ which we can write as follows:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1000\\,\\textrm g}{\\textrm{kg}}\n$$\n\nThis is our conversion factor.\n\nNow, multiplying $0.2\\,\\textrm{kg}$ by our conversion factor, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.2\\,\\text{kg} & =0.2\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\frac{1\\,000\\,\\text{g}}{\\text{kg}} \\\\  & =0.2\\,\\cancel{\\text{kg}}\\cdot \\frac{1\\,000\\,\\text{g}}{\\cancel{\\text{kg}}} \\\\  & =0.2\\cdot 1\\,000\\,\\text{g} \\\\  & =200\\,\\text{g}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $0.2\\,\\textrm{kg}$ is equivalent to $200 \\,\\text{g}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-142505\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"142505\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14051\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-142505\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Converting From Kilograms to Grams</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"142505\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            